            "context_budget",
            "The budget mode and the inline source limit",
            "Chosen by the worker cycle; degrades across retries"
          ],
          [
            "Worker packet",
            "Repair request when one exists, the target with its source inlined at the budget's limit, baseline evidence, the available-tools listing, canonical tool paths, decomp standards",
            "The claimed target packet and the standards files"
          ],
          [
