      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Standards are enforced, not consulted, at the gate. The deterministic layer is the review_lint diff scan: every finding cites the standard it violates, the scan fails closed when the scanner cannot run, and the QA verdict is combined into the handoff verdict. The worker-side check and the regression-check gate both go through the same scanner. Code: "
        },
        {
          "insert": "scan-diff.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "apps/server/src/core/validation/qa/scan-diff.ts",
              "label": "scan-diff.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "qa-gate.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "apps/server/src/core/validation/jobs/qa-gate.ts",
              "label": "qa-gate.ts"
            }
